  "_note": "MOCK DATA. Schema modeled on the publicly-documented iGOT Karmayogi FRAC (Framework of Roles, Activities and Competencies) competency dictionary structure: Competency ID (CID), Competency Label, Competency Type (B=Behavioural, D=Domain, F=Functional), and Level 1-5 descriptions. Real FRAC competency dictionaries are department-specific and not publicly published as structured data (source: FRAC Framework Overview, istm.gov.in / scribd 5144_12292020_iGOT). Skill labels below match skill_framework.json / officer_profiles.json used elsewhere in this prototype so all files stay linkable by name.",
  "source_reference": "Modeled on FRAC dictionary fields (Competency ID, Label, Type BDF, Level Description) as described in official Mission Karmayogi FRAC documentation. Real CIDs, level-wording and department-specific competencies are not public.",
